# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `lib/` (a Python build-dir convention). This app's
# lib/ is hand-written TypeScript source (the finance engine, extraction, etc.) and
# MUST be tracked. Re-include it here (a deeper .gitignore overrides the parent).
!/lib/
!/lib/**
.vercel
.next/
